iscovering the most famous \"seeing\" technology in history, X requested that all of his personal and scientific correspondence be burned upon his death. His executors honored this wish, leaving historians with very few personal letters or journals to study. Id X", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-27T15:48:03Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "I really thought you were starting a story", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-27T15:48:08Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Xray?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-27T15:48:13Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Roentgen", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-27T15:48:16Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "rontgen", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-27T15:48:19Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "Willy", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-27T15:48:35Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Willhelm Roentgen is correct ‎", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-27T15:48:42Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Wonka", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]